  "player_text": "I step up to the gate and tell the serjeant I'll take the standard toll and examination now.",
  "visible_motivation": "He said a lone traveler still passes by presenting for the usual toll and check, and the missing patrol does not change that.",
  "intended_meaning": "I want to get through the gate under the closer scrutiny instead of waiting on the patrol.",
